# Exclude bulk of OpenEMR source — Railway only needs the Dockerfile and our
# custom module. Everything else is already in openemr/openemr:latest base image.
*
!Dockerfile
!interface/
!interface/modules/
!interface/modules/custom_modules/
!interface/modules/custom_modules/oe-module-clinical-copilot/
!interface/modules/custom_modules/oe-module-clinical-copilot/**
